sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Api as ItemsHandler<br/>src/App/App.Host/Api/Http/Endpoint/ItemsHandler.cs
    participant Sender as ScopedSender<br/>src/BuildingBlocks/Pipeline/ScopedSender.cs
    participant Handler as AddItemHandler<br/>src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Commands/AddItemHandler.cs
    participant Service as ItemListsService<br/>src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Services/ItemListsService.cs
    participant Store as PostgresListStore<br/>src/Infrastructure/Postgres/Postgres/Stores/PostgresListStore.cs
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Api->>+Sender: Send(AddItemCommand)
    Note over Sender: opens the command's scope: one AppDbContext
    Sender->>+Handler: Handle, through the command middleware
    Handler->>+Service: AddAsync(listId, item)
    Service->>+Store: InsertAsync(listId, row)
    Store->>+DB: SaveChangesAsync: INSERT INTO list_items
    alt the row is stored
        DB-->>Store: the row
        Store-->>Service: done
        Service-->>Handler: done
        Handler-->>Sender: AddItemResult
    else unique index broken
        DB-->>-Store: 23505
        Store-->>-Service: DuplicateKeyException
        Service-->>-Handler: conflict, ItemAlreadyInList
        Handler-->>-Sender: conflict
    end
    Note over Sender: disposes the scope and its context
    Sender-->>-Api: the result, or the conflict
